<%# EVERY RULE THE TWO DRAWINGS USE, ONCE. A `<style>` inside each `<svg>`
    would be the tidier place for it -- the drawing would carry its own look --
    but a world with several insides puts several plans on one page and the
    rules would be repeated once per plan. So they are here, rendered once, and
    every selector is prefixed with the drawing it belongs to because a
    `<style>` in an HTML document is global however deeply it is nested.

    NO NEW COLOURS. Every value below is already in `layouts/debug.html.erb`,
    which is the stylesheet this page is rendered inside, and it means there what
    it means here: teal for something the app has written, amber for the thing
    to look at, dusty brown for a stub, red for a warning, violet for a fault in
    the records. %>
<style>
  .map-graph { font: 11px ui-monospace, "DejaVu Sans Mono", monospace; }
  .map-graph .edge { stroke: #33393f; stroke-width: 1; fill: none; }
  .map-graph .edge.frontier { stroke: #d8c07f; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .map-graph .edge.hazardous { stroke: #d88f7f; stroke-width: 2; }
  .map-graph .edge.suspect { stroke: #b79ad8; stroke-width: 2; }
  .map-graph .stairs { fill: #b79ad8; }
  .map-graph .node { fill: #12151a; stroke: #2f5a50; stroke-width: 1; }
  .map-graph .node.stub { fill: #0d0f12; stroke: #4a3f2e; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .map-graph .node.here { stroke: #d8c07f; stroke-width: 2; }
  .map-graph .name { fill: #cfd3d8; }
  .map-graph .stub-name { fill: #7a6a52; }
  .map-graph .here-name { fill: #d8c07f; }
  .map-graph .count { fill: #6b737b; }
  .map-graph .warn { fill: #d88f7f; }

  .map-plan { font: 11px ui-monospace, "DejaVu Sans Mono", monospace; }
  .map-plan .footprint { fill: #08090b; stroke: #33393f; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .map-plan .room { fill: #12151a; stroke: #2f5a50; }
  .map-plan .room.stub { fill: #0d0f12; stroke: #4a3f2e; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .map-plan .room.here { stroke: #d8c07f; stroke-width: 2; }
  .map-plan .door { stroke: #d8c07f; stroke-width: 3; }
  .map-plan .stair { fill: #b79ad8; }
  .map-plan .label { fill: #cfd3d8; }
  .map-plan .measure { fill: #6b737b; }
</style>
